# Git ignore

Keep secrets, build artifacts, and local-only files out of commits.

Never add:

- `node_modules/`, `dist/`, `dist-electron/`, `release/`
- `result/`, `results/` (review output; may contain PR diffs)
- `.env`, `.env.*` except `.env.example`
- `*.enc`, `token.enc` (OS-encrypted Bitbucket token)
- `docs/ARCHITECTURE.ar.md` (local Arabic notes only; English `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` is tracked)
- OS junk: `.DS_Store`, `Thumbs.db`, `Desktop.ini`

If a path belongs in `.gitignore` and is already tracked, untrack it with `git rm --cached` — do not force-add ignored files.
